coxlm is the inference package extracted from the cox research code. This
repository contains code only; it does not distribute model weights.
Backbones (e.g. Qwen3.5) are downloaded by the user from the Hugging Face Hub
and carry their own licences, as do any trained checkpoints and the datasets
they were trained on. Check each before redistributing trained weights.
